    "body": "Refs: cashubtc/nuts#372\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nUpdates NUT-17 quote subscriptions toward method-independent kinds while preserving compatibility with current mints:\r\n\r\n- prefers `mint_quote` and `melt_quote` when the mint advertises those commands\r\n- falls back to deprecated `bolt11_mint_quote` and `bolt11_melt_quote` when mint info only advertises the old command names\r\n- keeps deprecated `bolt11_*` subscription kinds in the public type surface for compatibility\r\n- updates mint-info fixtures and websocket/wallet event tests to cover generic and deprecated command names\r\n- asserts the multi-path melt quote test sends the expected MPP option without relying on a noisy negative request\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- `npx vitest run --project node test/transport/WSConnection.test.ts test/wallet/WalletEvents.test.ts test/wallet/wallet-init.node.test.ts test/wallet/wallet-auth.node.test.ts`\r\n- `npx vitest run --project integration test/integration.test.ts -t websocket --coverage=false`\r\n- `npm run api:check`\r\n- pre-push `eslint '**/*.{js,ts}'` and format checks",
